1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,583
On Nov 14, 2024, Samsung fell to 49,900 won

2
00:00:05,603 --> 00:00:07,781
People even called it '40,000-won Samsung'

3
00:00:07,801 --> 00:00:11,221
But this June it hit 374,000 won

4
00:00:11,241 --> 00:00:14,266
Up more than 7x in a year and a half

5
00:00:14,286 --> 00:00:18,840
Now it's 215,000 won, 42% below the peak

6
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,845
So can this price hold?

7
00:00:20,865 --> 00:00:23,496
The answer depends on these three things

8
00:00:23,516 --> 00:00:29,529
First, how much Big Tech raises next year's capex. That's the budget for AI chips and memory

9
00:00:29,549 --> 00:00:34,841
Second, how much Samsung HBM4 sold, and whether Nvidia supply keeps growing

10
00:00:34,861 --> 00:00:39,671
Third, how fast DRAM prices rise. If gains slow, the stock reacts first

11
00:00:39,691 --> 00:00:43,458
